<article class="env-definition" id="034I">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/034I">Definition <span data-tag="034I">4.34.2</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{C}$ be a category. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
Let $F : \mathcal{S} \to \mathcal{S}'$ be a $1$-morphism of fibred categories over $\mathcal{C}$. The <em>relative inertia of $\mathcal{S}$ over $\mathcal{S}'$</em> is the fibred category $\mathcal{I}_{\mathcal{S}/\mathcal{S}'} \to \mathcal{C}$ of Lemma <a href="/tag/034H" data-tag="034H">4.34.1</a>. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
By the <em>inertia fibred category $\mathcal{I}_\mathcal {S}$ of $\mathcal{S}$</em> we mean $\mathcal{I}_\mathcal {S} = \mathcal{I}_{\mathcal{S}/\mathcal{C}}$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</article>